      ("Do you work on projects with many bespoke details?", "Yes, that is exactly the kind of work where a network of reliable craftsmen is needed: joiners, metalworkers, glaziers, specialist layers."),
      ("Can we entrust you with only some trades?", "Yes: we can carry out only building works and finishes, or run the whole site as general contractor."),
